00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:35.500
For Israel, the same pages are a list aimed at firms it says have committed no wrongdoing.

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:40.980
Governments and buyers who deal with the listed companies now have a longer public role, and

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:45.480
And three countries have moved or said they will move from naming to trade restrictions.

